1.Tax Values Removed After Applying Shipping Estimate
Environment
OpenCart Public Demo
Browser
Google Chrome
Severity
High
Priority
High
Bug Type
Functional / Data Integrity
Status
New


2. Description
When a user has a taxable product in the shopping cart and applies a shipping estimate from the Estimate Shipping & Taxes section, the shipping charge is applied successfully; however, previously displayed tax components are removed from the cart totals.
The tax values remain missing after refreshing the page and are restored only after the user's session is reset through logout and login.
This creates an inconsistent cart calculation state and may result in an incorrect total being presented to the customer.

3. Preconditions
User is logged in.
A taxable product is available.
The product has applicable tax components configured.
Shopping cart contains at least one taxable item.
Cart totals display the applicable tax values before shipping estimation.

4. Steps to Reproduce
Open the OpenCart Demo storefront.
Log in with a valid customer account.
Add a taxable product such as iPhone to the shopping cart.
Navigate to Shopping Cart.
Verify that the cart totals display the applicable tax components.
Expand Estimate Shipping & Taxes.
Select:
Country: Egypt
Region: Ad Daqahliyah
Post Code: Valid postal code
Click Get Quotes.
Select Flat Shipping Rate — $8.00.
Click Apply Shipping.
Review the cart totals.
Refresh the page.
Review the cart totals again.
Log out and log back in.
Return to the cart and review the totals.

5. Expected Result
After applying the shipping method:
The selected shipping charge should be added to the cart total.
Existing tax calculations should remain valid or be recalculated according to the selected shipping destination.
If the selected destination results in no applicable tax, the affected tax value should be explicitly recalculated to $0.00 or otherwise handled according to the configured tax rules.
Refreshing the page should not cause an unexpected loss of valid cart calculation data.
The cart should remain in a consistent financial state throughout the session.

6. Actual Result
After applying the shipping method:
The shipping charge is applied successfully.
Previously displayed Eco Tax and VAT values are removed from the cart totals.
The missing tax values remain absent after refreshing the page.
The original tax state is restored only after the user logs out and logs back in.

